You find a gray stone and want to identify it, whether it's flint, or
touchstone, or luckstone. Then just name it "The Heart of Ahriman".
In case of a luckstone you'll get this message sequence

   What do you want to name this gray stone? The Heart of Ahriman
   While engraving your hand slips.
   You engrave: "The Heart of Ahhiman".

which identifies the luckstone. That's possible because there's an
artifact of that type of stone existing. In case of another gray stone
you'll write

   What do you want to name this gray stone? The Heart of Ahriman

and you'll obtain, e.g., an

   uncursed flint stone named The Heart of Ahriman


